Word lists of the SandFly keyboard's auto-correct and word suggestions

Each file has one word, a tab and its count per line, most frequent first.
They are the word lists of TapType, by the same author as SandFly.

en_us.txt, en_gb.txt
  Counts from count_1w.txt by Peter Norvig (https://norvig.com/ngrams/),
  from the Google Web Trillion Word Corpus, with contractions and informal
  words added.

de.txt, es.txt, fr.txt, pt_br.txt, pt_pt.txt, hu.txt, tr.txt, ru.txt, uk.txt, ar.txt
  FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave (https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords),
  word counts of OpenSubtitles 2018, under the Creative Commons
  Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Changed: the 50,000 most
  frequent words kept, tokens with characters outside the language's alphabet
  dropped, apostrophes normalized, Arabic vowel marks stripped, Russian text
  removed from the Ukrainian list, and place names and common first names
  capitalized. These files are under the same license.
